{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SRQ8MoQHfd1795067688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超在深圳出席亞太經濟合作組織(APEC)領導人非正式會議，期間與多位成員經濟體領袖會面。他表示，與智利總統共同見證簽署工作假期計劃協議，香港青年可獲一年工作假期簽證，為香港首次與拉丁美洲國家合作推出工作假期計劃 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:04:09.588858+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T09:28:25.937473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:57:17.618012+00:00","content_hash":"089d92391c483e0b259d1fe71a27b2e602bbcd319d0a593bdf25692c241d94e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}